==Journal==
{{journal entry|
The origin of mystic fibres, thread and cloth are wreathed in mystery. There's little to no mention in any written histories, which - on its own - seems unlikely. It is not subtle material. There should be log after log of merchants trading it, or actively avoiding trading it.

This leads me to belive that the mystic material is an elaborate troll. It's a plant - and I don't mean that in the floral definition. I think someone has introduced it as a joke, and I have a list of potential culprits. Brassica Prime: you{{sic|supposed to be "You"}} are number one on that list.
}}

