'''Oak trees''' are [[Woodcutting]] [[resource nodes]] and can be identified by different coloured leaves and darker bark than [[ash trees]]. Oak trees are located all over [[Brynmoor]] and [[Ghornfell]]. They can be chopped down using a [[bronze logging axe]] or better. Players will receive 28 [[oak logs]] in total upon chopping the entire tree and the [[Oak Stump|stump]].

Fully felling an oak tree grants 133 experience, excluding the stump.

Oak trees will regrow from stumps (or seeds through the [[Farming]] skill) after 3 in-game days (72 hours) after the tree has been felled. Cutting the stump will prevent the tree from growing again.

