'''Ore & stone storage''' is a [[storage]] container for storing stones and ore, unlocked at 62 [[Mining]]. Unlike the [[lumber storage]] that will automatically pickup planks from a [[sawmill]], the ore & stone storage will not automatically pick up ores and stone processed from a [[kiln]], [[furnace]], [[grindstone]], [[stonecutter]], or [[blast furnace]]. The ore & stone storage has the same capacity as an [[oak chest]] and less capacity than an [[iron chest]], despite it both taking up more space and being made from materials available later in a player's progression.

