The '''rune altar''' is a crafting table used to craft [[runes]], which are required to cast [[spells]]. To make runes, players need [[rune essence]], which comes from [[Rune Essence Geyser|essence geysers]] around the world, as well as from [[goblin pack]]s, [[garou pack]]s, and [[vault guardians]]. It does not have any special conditions to function.

Runes can be auto-crafted quickly or attuned by playing a simple minigame for more experience.{{Fact|text=explain}}

