Rune Essence Geyser:
{{Confuse|Rune Essence (Rock)|Rune Essence}}
{{Infobox Resource Node
|name = Rune Essence Geyser
|image = Rune Essence Geyser.png
|imagesizeh = 300
|release = 15 April 2025
|update = RuneScape: Dragonwilds is out!
|location = [[Ashenfall]]
|respawn = 3 Days
}}
'''Rune essence geysers''' are [[resource nodes]] that can be found in multiple regions across [[Ashenfall]]. They hold multiple [[rune essence]] rocks that lie around them, and have at most three [[Rune Essence (Rock)|rune essence rocks]] float above the geysers. The floating rune essence rocks can be shot down by using [[magic weapon]] attacks, or a [[Ranged weapons|ranged weapon]]. They can also be harvested by casting [[Rocksplosion]] at them, which both the floating rocks and the ones on the ground will take three in-game days to respawn, as long as players do not place anything directly on the node's spawn.

