{{Journal entry|
[[Lionel]] wasn't good at much in life, but he could swing a hammer, and he could swing it hard. As one of the [[Amalgamated]], born with hair of metal and skin of stone, Lionel worried that he would be hated as the Almalgamated in [[Brynmoor]] had been, but [[Fellhollow]] proved to be a kinder place.<br><br>Instead of being feared and shunned, his unnatural strength became a source of pride among his family and friends. Locals would challenge him to heft heavier and heavier things, cheering and lavishing him with praise as he did so.<br><br>Life had been good. He was happy. So, of course, it all had to end.<br><br>When the dead began to rise, arrows and blades seemed less effective than before, but crushing faces still got the job done. His family and friends escaped to the [[Silverthorn Keep]] and Lionel waited at the guardhouse, standing as a wall against the tide of the undead. Countless zombies and skeletons fell to his hammer, reduced to little more than powder in a few careful swings. He could have stemmed the tide if that were all, but when the [[zogre]] descended upon him, even Lionel's warhammer eventually broke against the strain.
}}

