'''Willow trees''' are [[Woodcutting]] [[resource nodes]] and a type of tree found in [[Fellhollow]], growing in areas known as 'willow groves', which require an [[iron logging axe]] (or better) to cut. 

Fully felling a willow tree grants 189 experience, excluding the stump.

Willow trees will regrow from stumps (or seeds through the [[Farming]] skill) after 3 in-game days (72 hours) after the tree has been felled. Cutting the stump will prevent the tree from growing again.

